--- b1 medium.en: What if one more year of work cost you four full Social Security checks? In 2027, for some people, it really does. For others, the very same paycheck costs nothing at all. The difference is two limits, one birthday and one rule that almost nobody mentions. Here are the exact numbers that Social Security published for 2027.
