--- b2 medium.en: Meet Dan and Ruth, two people who both work while they collect social security. Dan is 63, and he started his benefit at 62. Ruth was born in 1960, so she turned 67 in August of 2027. Both still have a paycheck. Same kind of job, same kind of money coming in, and a very different result. Let us see why.
