   DIFF replace copione: sixty two | sentito: 62
   DIFF replace copione: nineteen sixty | sentito: 1960
   DIFF replace copione: turns sixty seven | sentito: turned 67
   DIFF replace copione: twenty twenty seven | sentito: 2027
